</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS5" title="In 4 Experiments ‣ Spa3R: Predictive Spatial Field Modeling for 3D Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.5 </span>Qualitative Analysis</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Spa3R: Predictive Spatial Field Modeling for 3D Visual Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
